Chromium 158.0.8127.63 + the later changes of its release branch, up to
ec6a71ead56cbb5905f866a4aa7f331ce31f7860 (refs/branch-heads/8127@{#1778}), for the
158.0.8127.63 tree that chromium-158.0.8127.37-to-158.0.8127.63.patch makes.

Generated from the upstream diff chromium/src refs/tags/158.0.8127.63..ec6a71ead56cbb5905f866a4aa7f331ce31f7860
(no dependency's DEPS revision changed), as served by Gitiles, with
scripts/chromium-delta --branch-fixes (against the .63 tree's files, renames
included): left out are files not in the release tarball,
iOS/Android/ChromeOS/Mac/Windows-only files, tests and docs, translations
other than en-GB, PGO/orderfile/AFDO pointers, submodule pointer updates. chrome/VERSION, the DEPS
files and the stamp files stay at 158.0.8127.63.

Commits contributing to it (oldest first):
  fdc6e3d4266d [M158] Bound mDNS response parsing by received datagram length
  09a2b66e8ff6 Updating XTBs based on .GRDs from branch 8127
  fb2ddb35e20d [M158] Avoid use-after-free in WidgetInputHandlerImpl::DispatchEvent
  ec6a71ead56c [M158] [WebAudio] Validate renderSizeHint without sampleRate

Checked: applies to the 158.0.8127.63 tree; every patched file is
byte-identical to its version at the commit above.

